# Cloudflare Pages reads this file to attach extra response headers to every
# request — see https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers/
#
# CSP notes (read before tightening this further):
# - `script-src`/`style-src` need 'unsafe-inline': this is a fully static site
#   (no per-request server to mint a nonce), Layout.astro has a real inline
#   <script> for early dark-mode detection (must run before first paint, so it
#   can't be deferred to an external file), and several components set inline
#   `style="...hue-rotate(...)"` (category badges on the homepage/404). Hashing
#   every inline script/style across 20+ locales would be fragile to keep in
#   sync — 'unsafe-inline' is the deliberate, pragmatic tradeoff for a static
#   multi-page export like this one, not an oversight.
# - `connect-src`/`worker-src` allow two specific external hosts because
#   tools genuinely fetch from them at runtime (checked in source, not
#   guessed): Video Trim's @ffmpeg/core loads its wasm binary from
#   cdn.jsdelivr.net, Kubernetes YAML Validator fetches the public
#   yannh/kubernetes-json-schema JSON Schema files (never the user's own YAML)
#   from the same cdn.jsdelivr.net, and Remove Background
#   (@imgly/background-removal) fetches its ONNX models/wasm runtime from
#   staticimgly.com. Removing either host without self-hosting those assets
#   first would silently break that tool (CSP violations don't throw
#   catchable JS errors — they just fail the fetch).
# - 'wasm-unsafe-eval' is required for any of the WebAssembly-based tools
#   (ffmpeg.wasm, onnxruntime-web, heic2any/libheif) to compile at all.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), interest-cohort=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' 'wasm-unsafe-eval'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob:; media-src 'self' blob:; font-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' https://cdn.jsdelivr.net https://staticimgly.com; worker-src 'self' blob:; child-src 'self' blob:; frame-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'
